    "title": "Low-difference Johnson-positive wedge aggregate",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "At one fixed base support, sum every exact nonconstant side-width/difference-degree stratum with Delta=4e^2-N(e+d)>0. The low-difference Johnson cell bound and the exact step Delta(e,d+1)=Delta(e,d)-N give a complete aggregate at most 5N^3/16: deep cells Delta>=N cost below N^3/16, and there is at most one boundary cell 0<Delta<N per e, costing at most N^3/4 total. Every remaining nonconstant record satisfies 4e^2<=N(e+d) and e>=t_XR+d+1.",
